flowchart TD
 START([Open login window]) --> CHOOSE[Choose Sign Up]
 CHOOSE --> P1[signUp: personal information]
 P1 --> T1[(Insert signup)]
 T1 --> P2[signUp2: additional information]
 P2 --> T2[(Insert SignUpTwo)]
 T2 --> P3[signUp3: account and services]
 P3 --> GEN[Generate card/PIN values]
 GEN --> T3[(Insert signupthree and login)]
 T3 --> SHOW[Show generated values]
 SHOW --> END([Continue to deposit screen])
